WEBVTT

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.590
"M4A1"
"Leader of Griffin's AR Team."

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.590
Even alone, M4A1 continued to
hide and pursue her mission.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.890
"High-End Model Sangvis T-Dolls
with special powers and roles."

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.890
She defeated a Sangvis High-End Model
and met up with Griffin forces.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.480
M4A1.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.610
A doll with 16LAB.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.360
16LAB?

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.740
An organization that provides
technology to Griffin.

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:35.070
I'm looking for a certain doll.

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:37.660
Answer my questions, and I'll let you go.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.910
Found you, M4A1.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:49.880
You're safe, but what's
happening to them right now?

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.050
Talking about my friends was a mistake.

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:55.630
Let's go home, M4A1!

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:58.050
The commander is waiting!

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.800
Commander...

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:06.190
Big Sis M16... AR15, SOPII. I did it.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.070
You're awake?

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.580
Who are you?

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:26.160
I'm Kalina. The logistics officer
at this forward base.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.500
So you're not the commander.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.710
You were pretty badly injured, M4.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:38.390
But 16LAB's elite dolls are different
from the rest, aren't they?

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:40.720
You recover fast!

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.480
Um, I want to talk to the commander here.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.350
Well you see...

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:53.820
They're out on a mission to eliminate
the Sangvis from this area.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.570
Sangvis are still searching for AR Team.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.370
I need to go save them.

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.700
I can send her here when she arrives.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:09.580
No, I'll go see her myself.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:10.880
I see.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:13.210
I'll contact you later, then.

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:16.170
Get some rest.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:19.300
Call me on the phone
if you need something.

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.190
This is M4A1.

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.650
Can anyone hear me?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.480
Please respond.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.230
AR Team, this is M4A1.

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:00.650
Can anyone hear me?

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.700
Please respond.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.370
AR Team, this is M4A1.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.830
Can anyone hear me?

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.740
Please respond.

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:11.450
AR Team, this is M4A1.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.910
Can anyone hear me?

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:15.040
Please respond.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.000
--AR Team, this is M4A1.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.590
--I've been sending that message
out for almost 2 hours.
--AR Team, this is M4A1.

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.130
--I've been sending that message
out for almost 2 hours.
--Can anyone hear me?

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.960
--But nobody responds.
--Please respond.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.880
AR Team, this is M4A1--

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.260
M4A1.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.930
Big Sis M16!

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.810
Good timing.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:33.100
I was lucky to be in a spot
where I could contact you.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:36.020
Big Sis M16, what's your status?

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.730
Sangvis are nearby.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:44.150
I'm just about to switch into
silent mode to catch them off guard.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:46.200
I'll make this fast, then.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:51.330
I was rescued and am at a forward base.

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:56.290
The commander here should be putting
together a new rescue operation.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.250
What about you?

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:02.340
I got separated from the others while
holding off the enemies to the rear.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:05.300
They were safe the last time
I talked to them, but...

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:12.720
I'm fine. Find AR15 and SOPII first.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.930
Okay.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:16.480
Take care, Sister.

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:17.600
Don't worry.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:19.020
We'll see each other again.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.570
Big Sis is always like that.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.450
But I'm glad she's safe.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.160
M4, do you read?

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:33.950
This is AR15.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:38.250
From the look of your signal strength,
you've arrived at a base somewhere, huh?

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.170
Yes, AR15.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.000
You're safe too, right?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.840
Ask about me too, M4!

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:47.550
SOPII! You're there too?

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.430
Yes.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:51.050
We've met up, and we're fine!

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:53.600
Good.

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.940
Big Sis is still on the move.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.150
I'll come get you first.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.520
We'll be waiting!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:05.240
Are the coordinates you just
sent your present location?

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.280
Yes.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.450
--Come quick. Over.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.410
--I'm not done talking!
--Come quick. Over.

00:06:15.450 --> 00:06:16.790
What was that?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.580
At least we made contact.

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.550
Now I just have to wait
for the rescue operation.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:33.470
I didn't realize the base was so big.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.230
I'm sorry! Are you okay?

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:46.360
I'm fine... I wasn't looking, either.

00:06:49.610 --> 00:06:53.120
You're... that famous elite doll!

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:56.580
You're up and about already, huh?

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.460
Um...

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.790
This is T-Doll MP5.

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:05.460
She's the one who found
your disk and saved you.

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:10.590
I'm MG3, nice to meet you!

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:13.550
Looks like you got repaired!

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:18.890
When we found you, I thought we'd have
to back you up from your mental model.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:24.860
Um, I'm looking for the commander here.

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:28.690
We were on our way to see her now.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:37.370
Let's all go see her, then.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:40.790
Commander! We're here!

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:43.460
We're starting the meeting, Master.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.960
Get out of bed!

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:48.090
Ow! Ow! Stop it, G36.

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.300
I was up all night on a mission!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.680
Give back my blanket!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.180
No.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:57.760
A visitor?

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:02.560
I'm Gentiane, the commander here.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.850
And the person behind
Operation Sugar Cube.

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.730
I've seen her before.

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.620
You're M4, aren't you?

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.120
What are you doing here?

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.540
--I told you to stay in the repair room--

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:26.000
--I'm sorry, Commander.
--I told you to stay in the repair room--

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.630
I need to talk to you--

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.090
I read your logs.

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:34.970
The other three in your
team aren't back yet.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:38.350
And you need our help.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:39.930
Am I right?

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.350
Yes.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:47.610
Helian and Persica told me about you.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:52.940
So if you're really in a hurry, would
you tell me everything you know?

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:58.660
Including the coordinates you got by
secretly using the base's comms system?

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.750
The goal here is to wipe out

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:15.550
the Sangvis in this area and rescue
the surrounded members of AR Team.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:20.760
After landing, activate your
dummies and split into your units.

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.140
Unit 1 will follow heading 330.

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:28.230
Unit 2, heading 270.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:31.020
Unit 3, heading 300.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:34.280
Maintain visual distance on each other.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.460
Commander, Sangvis, 1,000 meters ahead.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:54.670
Heading 328, Altitude 20.

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:56.720
In the building?

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:59.140
That's how they were
hiding from our scans.

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:03.470
Follow the river, so they don't see you.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:05.230
Determine their positions.

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:06.100
Roger!

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:14.820
Commander, with our firepower,
this should be easy.

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.530
Why aren't we attacking directly?

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:19.240
--We need to hurry--
--M4!

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:22.740
This is an order.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:25.370
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:27.870
Unit 2, change heading to 225.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:32.670
Avoid urban areas and
keep an eye out for Sangvis.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:34.920
--Okay!
--Roger!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:39.430
M1919, leave Unit 3,
and meet up with Unit 2.

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.680
Okay!

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:43.890
Unit 3, and the rest of you.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:47.520
Kick some ass and lure out the Sangvis!

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.100
They're in the building at 320.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.310
Your goal is the bridge
over the river, understood?

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:53.690
--Right!
--Roger!

00:11:01.450 --> 00:11:03.620
Hey there!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:06.040
Come on and catch us, you idiots!

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:14.380
Come on!

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.000
Hey, hey!

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:19.420
Oops!

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.350
Over here!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:35.690
Good!

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.690
Lure them to the bridge!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:55.040
Now fire!

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.780
We can't let them get
back into the building.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.360
AR and SMG squads, that's your cue!

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.120
Finish them.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:49.760
An elite doll like you might not be
satisfied with fighting this way, but...

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:51.730
Oh, no...

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:58.570
But most of Griffin's weapons are
antiques from a long time ago,

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:01.940
and they were all
formerly civilian models.

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:07.740
We use Fire Control Cores and the
Imprint System to enhance their strength,

00:13:07.740 --> 00:13:09.990
but it doesn't make
them physically tougher.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.960
Do you think they could go
head-on against Sangvis,

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:16.960
who are fully armed
with the latest weaponry,

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:20.340
and escape unharmed?

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:24.260
I don't want them to die.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:28.470
Dolls don't die as easily as humans.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.680
But I want you to come back safe anyway.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:36.600
Especially you.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:38.190 --> 00:13:42.650
So contact your friends while
you've got the chance, okay?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.360
Oh, right!

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.660
AR15, SOPII...

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:51.200
I'm at the target point!

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:52.790
Where are you?

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.540
M4!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:56.830
SOPII!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.630
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:06.340
SOPII, where's AR15?

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:13.770
SOPII? What's wrong?

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:17.270
AR15 left.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:25.490
The Sangvis intercepted
our last transmission.

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:31.160
AR15 left alone to buy time.

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.620
Time?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.080
Time for what?

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:37.960
Sangvis found the base's location.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.330
They're headed there.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.630
They're after the base?

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:48.880
M4, let's go help AR15!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:51.390
Calm down, SOPII.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:53.640
First we need to report to the commander.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:07.150
Just throw all the ammo
we've got at the Sangvis!

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:08.570
You idiot!

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.200
Save ammo!

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.660
We're surrounded by the enemy!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.280
Sheesh...

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.580
Outside of the landing strip crew,

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.330
everybody left in the
base is a problem child.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:30.550
SOPII, I know you're worried about AR15,

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:34.100
but getting back to
the base is our priority.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.060
But...

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.220
It's fine.

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:41.640
When we destroy the Sangvis,
we can go save AR15.

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:43.980
The base is already under attack.

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.480
How much longer till we get there?

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:48.900
Twenty minutes.

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.570
That's bad.

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:55.990
Don't treat me like I'm dead.

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:58.290
I can last twenty minutes!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.370
Commander!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:03.630
There's no time! Get out of there!

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:06.670
Huh? I'm not running--

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:11.300
M4 and I can't handle them all ourselves!

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:15.720
So you're SOPII?

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.430
You're a strange doll,
like the rumors say.

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:22.890
You've been fighting by
yourself until now, right?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:29.860
But you don't need to fight alone anymore.

00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:35.320
SOPII, the commander and the dolls
at HQ are all fighting with us.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.490
They'll all help us.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.500
It's not like it was before.

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:53.930
Then... we have comrades, too?

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:55.510
Yup.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:58.560
SOPII, let's do our best!

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.770
Yeah, nice to meet you!

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:05.100
Contract complete!

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:06.940
Now I'm connected to all of you!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.730
Give us your orders, Commander!

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.740
You're such a kid.

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.280
We're almost there!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:19.910
What's the situation?

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.540
More lively than a summer festival!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:26.830
They just keep coming and coming!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.000
How much longer?

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.460
Our ETA is one minute.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:34.300
Things around the base are
getting a little too exciting.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:37.260
Rescue teams, get here
as soon as possible.

00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:38.470
Roger!

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:43.640
Rescue teams, can you hear me?

00:17:43.640 --> 00:17:46.310
If you land at the heliport, they'll just
shoot you on your way down!

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.770
Land in front of warehouse 4!

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:54.150
No need to bother!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.530
SOPII, they're about to
break through the main gate!

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:01.530
Hurry!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.790
Okay! On my way!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.840
Hey. You okay?

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:32.770
Going on ahead!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:36.950
SOPII, if you get ahead of us, it makes it
harder for the ones behind you to aim!

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:39.360
Did you forget how
defensive formations work?

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:43.240
If I waited for all of them,
we'd be here all night!

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:06.560
I can't have you taking
all the fun for yourself.

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:17.860
Oh! A force shield!

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:20.160
SOPII, now!

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.570
Okay!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:36.170
Nice job, all of you guys!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:43.640
M4, it's fun to fight with comrades, huh?

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:47.060
I see. That's good to hear.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:04.950
Commander! The Sangvis retreated! Hooray!

00:20:04.950 --> 00:20:07.910
SOPII, you're getting
too excited by yourself.

00:20:07.910 --> 00:20:10.960
We all won this victory together.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.540
Well, I contributed! So it's okay, right?

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:15.960
Hey, Commander, tell me I did good!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:16.630
--Come on! Come on!

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:20.260
--Yes, yes. You're the best, SOPII.
--Come on! Come on!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:24.760
From now on, do your best and
follow your commander's orders.

00:20:24.760 --> 00:20:26.720
Okay! I'll be good!

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:31.810
As long as I can take down that Hunter.

00:20:31.810 --> 00:20:33.100
Hunter?

00:20:34.270 --> 00:20:36.940
Model SP721, Hunter.

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:42.360
According to information AR15 got,
that's the ringleader of this area.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:45.570
So what about AR15?

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.370
Where did she go?

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:53.290
AR15 acted as a decoy so I could escape.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.960
Hunter is clever.

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:59.960
We need to hurry or
AR15 will be in danger!

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:04.380
Commander, let's go save AR15!

00:21:05.550 --> 00:21:08.300
They just hit our base.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:10.270
We can't launch a mission right now.

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:18.360
And I'm still new. I can't move
units without permission.

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:21.400
So the answer is... no.

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:24.860
I can't allow another mission.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:40.050
But M4 said all of you would help us.

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:51.560
Is it over already, AR15?

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:54.980
Everyone's in danger because of me.

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:56.900
If this can atone for that...

00:21:59.770 --> 00:22:06.400
Griffin allows the AR Team to act
without human commanders, I guess.

00:22:09.030 --> 00:22:11.490
And you're part of that unit.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:17.620
You looked almost cruelly logical.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:20.420
I can't believe you're so emotional.

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:26.420
Your information's pretty one-sided.

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:29.180
You should update your database.

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:33.180
Someday.

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:37.480
All of our problems will be solved
as long as we can get our target.

00:22:40.770 --> 00:22:43.570
M4A1...

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:46.610
Why do you want her so bad?

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:52.080
It doesn't matter.

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:58.920
What's important is that if we use
you as bait, M4 will come to us.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:01.750
That's what you get for letting
your emotions take over.

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:07.590
A real hunter silently
waits for her prey.

00:24:43.060 --> 00:24:46.360
Episode 5: "Silence 02."
